        "note": "The county's hotellingActivityDistribution: 12 rows at zone 261610, diesel only, in three model-year bands (1950-2009, 2010-2020, 2021-9999). The input side of a row merge; the default's 36 rows are all at 990000, so the merge ADDS these, and zone 261610 is then the best match for a Washtenaw run.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
